{"seq":4,"slug":"syntax-and-highlighting","title":"语法与高亮","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/editor-architecture/syntax-and-highlighting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tokenization-strategies","title":"分词策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/editor-architecture/syntax-and-highlighting/tokenization-strategies","wordCount":1079,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"tree-sitter-integration","title":"Tree-sitter 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/editor-architecture/syntax-and-highlighting/tree-sitter-integration","wordCount":989,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"theming-system","title":"主题系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/editor-architecture/syntax-and-highlighting/theming-system","wordCount":898,"readingTime":4},{"seq":4,"slug":"bracket-matching","title":"括号匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/editor-architecture/syntax-and-highlighting/bracket-matching","wordCount":1006,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"语法与高亮-简介\">语法与高亮 简介</h1><p>语法高亮是代码编辑器最直观的功能之一——不同类型的代码元素用不同颜色渲染，帮助开发者快速理解代码结构。在底层，这涉及词法分析、语法解析、Token 分类、主题映射等多个层次的技术。</p>\n<p>本章将深入四个核心主题：</p>\n<p><strong>分词策略</strong>解析基于行的分词机制，对比 TextMate 语法（Oniguruma 正则）和 Monarch（声明式）两种主流方案，以及增量分词和 Token 缓存的优化策略。</p>\n<p><strong>Tree-sitter 集成</strong>介绍 Tree-sitter 的增量解析能力，包括具体语法树的构建、高亮查询、编辑操作的增量更新和错误恢复机制。</p>\n<p><strong>主题系统</strong>讲解 Token 分类体系（scope selectors）、LSP 语义 Token 的融合、主题颜色解析以及 CSS 自定义属性的映射。</p>\n<p><strong>括号匹配</strong>涵盖括号对着色、括号匹配算法、彩虹括号、自动闭合/包围以及基于缩进的代码折叠。</p>\n<p>建议从分词策略开始阅读，它是语法高亮管线的入口。</p>\n"}